OL,3,AClaude-maker Anthropic poised for more
OL,4,Athan $1.4tn stock market debut
OL,5,
OL,6,FAnthropic is poised to hit a value of
OL,7,Fmore than $1.4 trillion (#1.1 trillion)
OL,8,Fwhen it debuts on the public stock
OL,9,Fmarket.
OL,11,FThe artificial intelligence (AI)
OL,12,Fcompany behind the popular chatbot
OL,13,FClaude said it will price shares at $83
OL,14,Feach when it lists on Thursday on the
OL,15,FNasdaq, a tech-focused stock exchange
OL,16,Fbased in New York.
OL,18,FThat price will make it one of the most
OL,19,Fhighly valued companies in the world.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
